{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "5481f80cad9a1d7b",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "The conventions step (in thread-spec and thread-tasks)",
			"x": -840,
			"y": -260,
			"width": 1820,
			"height": 370,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "f1a4f0aef89db731",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Find the policies in the wiki that apply to a thread or a task, so the work follows them. **thread-spec** runs it for the thread; **thread-tasks** runs it for each task.",
			"x": -800,
			"y": -440,
			"width": 620,
			"height": 110
		},
		{
			"id": "3a8a65c74589d6de",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**context** for the scope: every policy on the chain, nearest first",
			"x": -780,
			"y": -120,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "cd62bcdbc24107af",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "design/Entities/Context Chain.md",
			"x": -1260,
			"y": -210,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 400,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "51d866072cee5864",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "For each candidate policy",
			"x": -400,
			"y": -100,
			"width": 240,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "78b61ab79f731f55",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Does it apply to this work?",
			"x": -60,
			"y": -100,
			"width": 240,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "63d9e87a89745c76",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Keep it, with one line on why",
			"x": 280,
			"y": -200,
			"width": 240,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "b5e3911d6b3f1c87",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Pass",
			"x": 280,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 120,
			"height": 50,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "48470ac352e27eca",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Write the kept policies under `## Conventions` in the spec or the task, each linked",
			"x": 620,
			"y": -120,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "248d2f58838e2c5f",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**thread-task** follows them; **thread-review** checks the work against them",
			"x": 1020,
			"y": -120,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "6aa3fe1e8eab5c9b",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Legend**\n\n- cyan: tool (code)\n- yellow: skill or agent (model)\n- purple: document or entity\n- green: hook (code, automatic)\n- orange: the user\n- red: a gate or a refusal",
			"x": -1260,
			"y": -560,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 260
		}
	],
